<title>NETHERLANDS: AEA freight traffic figures within Europe for 1995.</title>
<headline>AEA freight traffic figures within Europe for 1995.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air freight traffic within Europe in 1996 when measured in tonne kilometres showed an increase of 6.8 percent which just outpaced a 6.7 percent increase in capacity leading to a small 0.1 point increase in the overall load factor, Association of European Airlines (AEA) statistics show.</p>
<p>					    '96	'95	pct change</p>
<p>								    96/95</p>
<p>..Freight tonne-km (millions)     942.67   910.75   up   3.5</p>
<p>..Freight on pax services (pct)    82.6     85.7    down 3.1 pts</p>
<p>..Tonne-kms (millions)	    10400.0   9738.7    up   6.8</p>
<p>..Available tonne-km (millions) 19378.0  18162.8    up   6.7</p>
<p>..Overall load factor (pct)	  53.7     53.6    up   0.1 pts</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
